tDigiFort | Precision Freight &amp; Enterprise Logistics\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"GetDigiFort (Owned and Operated by DMB Transit Inc.) is a premier North American asset-based carrier and supply chain solutions provider, operating over 450 Class-8 power units and specialized trailing assets.\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://vanguardiafreight.com\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"GetDigiFort\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"GetDigiFort | Precision Freight &amp; Enterprise Logistics\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"GetDigiFort (Owned and Operated by DMB Transit Inc.) is a premier North American asset-based carrier and supply chain solutions provider, operating over 450 Class-8 power units and specialized trailing assets.\"/><link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"/favicon.svg\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\"/><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"LogisticsService\",\"@id\":\"https://vanguardiafreight.com/#organization\",\"name\":\"GetDigiFort\",\"legalName\":\"DMB Transit Inc.\",\"url\":\"https://vanguardiafreight.com\",\"logo\":\"https://vanguardiafreight.com/images/brand-logo.png\",\"description\":\"GetDigiFort (Owned and Operated by DMB Transit Inc.) is a premier North American asset-based carrier and supply chain solutions provider, operating over 450 Class-8 power units and specialized trailing assets.\",\"email\":\"quotes@getdigifort.com\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"4500 DigiFort Logistics Way, Suite 800\",\"addressLocality\":\"Chicago\",\"addressRegion\":\"IL\",\"postalCode\":\"60666\",\"addressCountry\":\"United States\"},\"areaServed\":[\"US\",\"CA\",\"MX\"],\"hasOfferCatalog\":{\"@type\":\"OfferCatalog\",\"name\":