ucide lucide-clock\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg> <span>Average Dispatch Turnaround: 15 Mins</span></div><div class=\"header-stat-pill\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#38BDF8\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg> <span>38 Transcontinental Hubs</span></div><div class=\"header-stat-pill\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FBBF24\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"16\" x=\"2\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7\"></path></svg> <span>dispatch@getdigifort.com</span></div><div class=\"header-stat-pill\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#A78BFA\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> <span>USDOT #3849120 | MC-892104</span></div></div></div></section><section class=\"container\" style=\"margin-top:4rem\"><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 2fr;gap:3rem\"><div><div style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:var(--radius-lg);padding:2rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.5rem;margin-bottom:2rem\"><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:1.35rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-primary)\">24/7 Digital Dispatch Desk</h3><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.85rem\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail\" style=\"color:var(--color-accent);flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"16\" x=\"2\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7\"></path></svg><div><strong style=\"display:block;font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--color-primary)\">dispatch@getdigifort.com</strong><span style=\"font-size:0.8125rem;color:var(--color-text-muted)\">24/7/365 Central Dispatch Desk</span></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.85rem\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail\" style=\"color:var(--color-accent);flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"16\" x=\"2\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7\"></path></svg><div><strong style=\"display:block;font-size:1rem;color:var(--color-primary)\">quotes@getdigifort.com</strong><span style=\"font-size:0.8125rem;color:var(--color-text-muted)\">Average rate response time: 15 minutes</span></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.85rem\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin\" style=\"color:var(--color-accent);flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><div><strong style=\"display:block;font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--color-primary)\">Corporate Headquarters:</strong><span style=\"font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary);line-height:1.5\">4500 DigiFort Logistics Way, Suite 800<br/>Chicago<!-- -->, <!-- -->IL<!-- --> <!-- -->60666</span></div></div></div><div style=\"background-color:var(--color-primary);color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:var(--radius-lg);padding:2rem\"><div style=\"font-size:0.8125rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-accent);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:0.5rem\">Carrier Licensing &amp; Authority</div><div style=\"font-size:1rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:0.5rem\">USDOT 3849120<!-- --> • <!-- -->MC-892104</div><p style=\"font-size:0.875rem;color:#94A3B8;line-height:1.6\">SCAC Code: <strong>DMBT</strong> | Insurance Coverage: <strong>$10M Primary Liability &amp; Cargo Policy</strong>.</p></div></div><div style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:var(--radius-lg);padding:2.5rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)\"><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--color-primary);margin-bottom:0.5rem\">Send an Operational Inquiry</h3><p style=\"font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--color-text-muted);margin-bottom:2rem\">Fill out the form below to connect with a regional dispatch officer or account executive.</p><form style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1.25rem\"><div><label style=\"display:block;font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-text-secondary);margin-bottom:0.4rem\">First Name *</label><input type=\"text\" required=\"\" placeholder=\"e.g. Michael\" style=\"width:100%;padding:0.75rem 1rem;border-radius:var(--radius-md);border:1px solid var(--color-border)\"/></div><div><label style=\"display:block;font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-text-secondary);margin-bottom:0.4rem\">Last Name *</label><input type=\"text\" required=\"\" placeholder=\"e.g. Vance\" style=\"width:100%;padding:0.75rem 1rem;border-radius:var(--radius-md);border:1px solid var(--color-border)\"/></div><div style=\"grid-column:1 / -1\"><label style=\"display:block;font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-text-secondary);margin-bottom:0.4rem\">Corporate Email *</label><input type=\"email\" required=\"\" placeholder=\"mvance@company.com\" style=\"width:100%;padding:0.75rem 1rem;border-radius:var(--radius-md);border:1px solid var(--color-border)\"/></div><div style=\"grid-column:1 / -1\"><label style=\"display:block;font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-text-secondary);margin-bottom:0.4rem\">Topic of Inquiry</label><select style=\"width:100%;padding:0.75rem 1rem;border-radius:var(--radius-md);border:1px solid var(--color-border);background-color:#FFFFFF\"><option>Request Freight Rate Quote</option><option>Dedicated Fleet Allocation</option><option>Cold Chain GDP Audit</option><option>Claims &amp; Cargo Insurance</option><option>Careers &amp; Driver Opportunities</option></select></div><div style=\"grid-column:1 / -1\"><label style=\"display:block;font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-text-secondary);margin-bottom:0.4rem\">Message / Freight Requirements *</label><textarea rows=\"4\" required=\"\" placeholder=\"Describe your freight origin/destination, volume requirements, or equipment needs...\" style=\"width:100%;padding:0.75rem 1rem;border-radius:var(--radius-md);border:1px solid var(--color-border)\"></textarea></div><div style=\"grid-column:1 / -1\"><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"width:100%;padding:0.9rem\"><span>Submit Inquiry to Dispatch</span></button></div></form></div></div></section><section class=\"container\" style=\"margin-top:5rem\"><div style=\"text-align:center;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto 3rem auto\"><span class=\"badge-tag\">REGIONAL TERMINAL NETWORK</span><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:2.25rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--color-primary);margin-top:0.75rem\">Dispatch Hubs &amp; Cross-Dock Facilities</h2></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 1fr);gap:1.5rem\"><div style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:var(--radius-md);padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border)\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:0.75rem\"><h4 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-primary)\">Chicago<!-- -->, <!-- -->IL</h4><span style=\"font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:700;background-color:var(--color-secondary-subtle);color:var(--color-secondary);padding:0.2rem 0.55rem;border-radius:var(--radius-sm)\">VNDG-CHI-01</span></div><p style=\"font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary);margin-bottom:0.75rem\">4500 Vanguardia Logistics Way, Suite 800</p><div style=\"font-size:0.8125rem;color:var(--color-text-muted)\">Dispatch: <strong>chicago.dispatch@vanguardiafreight.com</strong></div></div><div style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:var(--radius-md);padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border)\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:0.75rem\"><h4 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-primary)\">Atlanta<!-- -->, <!-- -->GA</h4><span style=\"font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:700;background-color:var(--color-secondary-subtle);color:var(--color-secondary);padding:0.2rem 0.55rem;border-radius:var(--radius-sm)\">VNDG-ATL-02</span></div><p style=\"font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary);margin-bottom:0.75rem\">1850 Enterprise Parkway, Building B</p><div style=\"font-size:0.8125rem;color:var(--color-text-muted)\">Dispatch: <strong>atlanta.dispatch@vanguardiafreight.com</strong></div></div><div style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:var(--radius-md);padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border)\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:0.75rem\"><h4 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-primary)\">Dallas-Fort Worth<!-- -->, <!-- -->TX</h4><span style=\"font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:700;background-color:var(--color-secondary-subtle);color:var(--color-secondary);padding:0.2rem 0.55rem;border-radius:var(--radius-sm)\">VNDG-DFW-03</span></div><p style=\"font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary);margin-bottom:0.75rem\">9200 Alliance Freight Boulevard</p><div style=\"font-size:0.8125rem;color:var(--color-text-muted)\">Dispatch: <strong>dallas.dispatch@vanguardiafreight.com</strong></div></div><div style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:var(--radius-md);padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border)\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:0.75rem\"><h4 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-primary)\">Los Angeles / Inland Empire<!-- -->, <!-- -->CA</h4><span style=\"font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:700;background-color:var(--color-secondary-subtle);color:var(--color-secondary);padding:0.2rem 0.55rem;border-radius:var(--radius-sm)\">VNDG-LAX-04</span></div><p style=\"font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary);margin-bottom:0.75rem\">3400 Inland Logistics Center Drive</p><div style=\"font-size:0.8125rem;color:var(--color-text-muted)\">Dispatch: <strong>la.dispatch@vanguardiafreight.com</strong></div></div><div style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:var(--radius-md);padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border)\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:0.75rem\"><h4 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-primary)\">Columbus<!-- -->, <!-- -->OH</h4><span style=\"font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:700;background-color:var(--color-secondary-subtle);color:var(--color-secondary);padding:0.2rem 0.55rem;border-radius:var(--radius-sm)\">VNDG-CMH-05</span></div><p style=\"font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary);margin-bottom:0.75rem\">7100 Rickenbacker Intermodal Expressway</p><div style=\"font-size:0.8125rem;color:var(--color-text-muted)\">Dispatch: <strong>columbus.dispatch@vanguardiafreight.com</strong></div></div><div style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:var(--radius-md);padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border)\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:0.75rem\"><h4 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-primary)\">Harrisburg / Lehigh Valley<!-- -->, <!-- -->PA</h4><span style=\"font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:700;background-color:var(--color-secondary-subtle);color:var(--color-secondary);padding:0.2rem 0.55rem;border-radius:var(--radius-sm)\">VNDG-MDT-06</span></div><p style=\"font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary);margin-bottom:0.75rem\">2200 Interstate Corridor Commerce Park</p><div style=\"font-size:0.8125rem;color:var(--color-text-muted)\">Dispatch: <strong>harrisburg.dispatch@vanguardiafreight.com</strong></div></div></div></section><section class=\"container\" style=\"margin-top:5rem\"><div style=\"text-align:center;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto 3rem auto\"><span class=\"badge-tag\">FREIGHT &amp; OPERATIONAL FAQ</span><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:2.25rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--color-primary);margin-top:0.75rem\">Frequently Asked Questions by Enterprise Shippers</h2></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.25rem;max-width:840px;margin:0 auto\"><div style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:var(--radius-md);padding:1.75rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)\"><h4 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-primary);margin-bottom:0.5rem\">What is Vanguardia’s emergency dispatch response SLA?</h4><p style=\"font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary);line-height:1.6\">Central Dispatch operates 24/7/365. For expedited or time-critical shipments, dedicated power units can be dispatched within 30 minutes of booking confirmation.</p></div><div style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:var(--radius-md);padding:1.75rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)\"><h4 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-primary);margin-bottom:0.5rem\">How does Vanguardia handle cold chain temperature logging?</h4><p style=\"font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary);line-height:1.6\">Every reefer trailer features satellite telematics streaming supply air, return air, and internal zone temperatures every 60 seconds. Shippers receive automated PDF excursion logs upon delivery.</p></div><div style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:var(--radius-md);padding:1.75rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)\"><h4 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-primary);margin-bottom:0.5rem\">Can Vanguardia manage dedicated customer fleets?</h4><p style=\"font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary);line-height:1.6\">Yes. Vanguardia offers Dedicated Fleet Solutions where we assign customized Class-8 power units, trailing assets, and dedicated drivers exclusively to your manufacturing or retail facility.</p></div></div></section></div></main><footer class=\"Footer_footer__eNA9m\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"Footer_footerGrid__Zjk4v\"><div class=\"Footer_brandCol__6UIwg\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem\"><div style=\"width:36px;height:36px;background-color:var(--color-accent);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#FFFFFF\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-truck\"><path d=\"M14 18V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2\"></path><path d=\"M15 18H9\"></path><path d=\"M19 18h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3.65a1 1 0 0 0-.22-.624l-3.48-4.35A1 1 0 0 0 17.52 8H14\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><div><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:800;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.02em;display:block\">GETDIGIFORT</span><span style=\"font-size:0.65rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-accent);letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase\">DMB TRANSIT INC.</span></div></div><p class=\"Footer_brandDesc__JyP2_\">GetDigiFort (Owned and Operated by DMB Transit Inc.) is a premier North American asset-based carrier and supply chain solutions provider, operating over 450 Class-8 power units and specialized trailing assets.<!-- --> Asset-based transportation, GDP cold chain, and high-volume FTL freight solutions across North America.</p><div style=\"font-size:0.8125rem;color:#CBD5E1\"><strong>Operational Credentials:</strong> <!-- -->USDOT 3849120<!-- --> | <!-- -->MC-892104<!-- --> | SCAC: <!-- -->DMBT</div><div class=\"Footer_certList__YOlHk\"><span class=\"Footer_certBadge___gRrj\">ISO 9001:2015 Certified</span><span class=\"Footer_certBadge___gRrj\">EPA SmartWay Transport Partner</span><span class=\"Footer_certBadge___gRrj\">TIA Certified Transportation Broker</span><span class=\"Footer_certBadge___gRrj\">C-TPAT Tier 2 Validated Carrier</span><span class=\"Footer_certBadge___gRrj\">GDP Compliant Cold Chain Carrier</span></div></div><div><h4 class=\"Footer_colTitle__u3AX5\">Freight Services</h4><ul class=\"Footer_linkList__K_ONQ\"><li><a href=\"/services/full-truckload-ftl\">Full Truckload (FTL)</a></li><li><a href=\"/services/temperature-controlled-cold-chain\">Refrigerated Cold Chain</a></li><li><a href=\"/services/heavy-haul-specialized\">Heavy Haul &amp; Over-Dimensional</a></li><li><a href=\"/services/intermodal-rail-freight\">Intermodal Rail Freight</a></li><li><a href=\"/services/warehousing-contract-logistics\">Contract Warehousing</a></li><li><a href=\"/services/expedited-critical-freight\">Expedited &amp; Hot-Shot Freight</a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class=\"Footer_colTitle__u3AX5\">Company &amp; Insights</h4><ul class=\"Footer_linkList__K_ONQ\"><li><a href=\"/about\">About GetDigiFort</a></li><li><a href=\"/fleet\">Fleet Specifications</a></li><li><a href=\"/industries\">Industries Served</a></li><li><a href=\"/research\">Research &amp; Insights</a></li><li><a href=\"/blog\">Logistics Blog</a></li><li><a href=\"/contact\">Terminal Network</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"Footer_contactCol__dVXsM\"><h4 class=\"Footer_colTitle__u3AX5\">Dispatch Command</h4><div class=\"Footer_contactItem__M0DvS\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><div><strong>Headquarters:</strong><br/>4500 DigiFort Logistics Way, Suite 800<br/>Chicago<!-- -->, <!-- -->IL<!-- --> <!-- -->60666</div></div><div class=\"Footer_contactItem__M0DvS\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"16\" x=\"2\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7\"></path></svg><div><strong>24/7 Digital Dispatch:</strong><br/><a href=\"mai